                                                "sense_id": "b274a0f0-b85f-31af-bc71-2bb8aa60895f",
                                                "text": "Becoming an astronaut was his grail."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "5dd58693-3867-4a15-bea6-777aa7e26c9e",
                                                "sense_id": "b274a0f0-b85f-31af-bc71-2bb8aa60895f",
                                                "text": "How many of them had found the item they dreamt of, their personal grails?"
